 "description": "FF-46 (opf#362): the commissioned proprietary script, emoji, math and code-table names, including Yu Gothic whose native visual finding remains separate. Own-host loading and drawing do not promote native visual acceptance; documented-visual still requires a native pass and the name's own fixture in every host. Per name: the route the font policy gives it (core fontPolicyFor(name).replacement.family; for a symbol-encoded name the first face of its code-table chain) and the policy sizeAdjust where there is one; per script the face that draws it (the policy route when it covers the script, otherwise the designated script face, as for Sylfaen's Armenian and Georgian) and samples: original FF-44 corpus text and FF-45 emoji and math samples that the face covers completely (test/script-family-fixture.mjs picks them for that face), or, for a code table, every code core's symbol-font encodings map to Unicode, with the chain face that draws each one. The samples make no claim of translation quality; they exist to exercise shaping. No proprietary font file is read.",
